---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  lang="en"
  title="Property & Home Insurance in Cambodia | AG Cambodia"
  description="Protect the value of your real estate against fire, water damage, floods, explosions, windstorms, landslides and vehicle impact."
  quoteHref="#form"
>
  <!-- Page hero -->
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="page-hero-grid">
        <div class="page-hero-copy">
          <nav class="breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
            <a href="/">Home</a>
            <span aria-hidden="true">/</span>
            <a href="/general-insurance-in-cambodia/">General Insurance</a>
            <span aria-hidden="true">/</span>
            <span>Property Insurance</span>
          </nav>
          <p class="eyebrow eyebrow-light">General Insurance</p>
          <h1>Property Insurance in Cambodia</h1>
          <p class="hero-lead">Protect the value of your real estate against fire, water damage, floods, explosions, windstorms, landslides and vehicle impact — with tariff-rate Fire Insurance and local claims support.</p>
          <div class="hero-ctas">
            <a href="#form" class="btn btn-gold">Get a Quote</a>
            <a href="tel:+85523998018" class="btn btn-outline-light">Call us</a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="page-hero-visual">
          <img src="/assets/property-insurance.webp" alt="Business owner reviewing a warehouse property" width="600" height="400" />
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Article -->
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container article-grid">
      <div class="article-copy">
        <p class="eyebrow">Property Insurance</p>
        <h2>Comprehensive protection for your property</h2>
        <p>In the Kingdom of Cambodia, the fast-growing real estate sector has significantly enhanced the value of assets, underscoring the necessity for comprehensive protection against unforeseen incidents. Property insurance offers a safeguard for your buildings, covering a wide array of accidental damages including those caused by fire, water damage, floods, explosions, windstorms, landslides, and vehicle impacts among others.</p>
        <p>With a <strong>Property (All) Risks</strong> policy, also called a &ldquo;Fire Insurance&rdquo;, you can cover any kind of property. It could be for residential or professional use: from house, condos or apartments to factories, high rise buildings, hospitals and clinics, schools, hotels or restaurants.</p>
        <p>The insurer will pay the repair or reinstatement of your loss property after a survey to assess the damage. With property insurance you guarantee the integrity of your real estate investment and ensure you are still in business in case of loss. Fire Insurance is under Tariffs rule for risks below 50 Million Dollars in value, therefore all insurers apply the same rates according to the category of property — with our advice you can cover only the risks you need and receive counselling and management to ensure your policy really protects your property.</p>
        <a href="#form" class="btn btn-gold">Get a Quote</a>
      </div>

      <aside class="peril-card">
        <h3>What's covered</h3>
        <ul class="peril-list">
          <li>Fire</li>
          <li>Water Damage</li>
          <li>Floods</li>
          <li>Explosions</li>
          <li>Windstorms</li>
          <li>Landslides</li>
          <li>Vehicle Impact</li>
        </ul>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Related coverages -->
  <section class="section section-cream">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="eyebrow">Extend your cover</p>
      <h2>Related property coverages</h2>
      <p class="section-lead">Pair your Property All Risks policy with these complementary covers for complete protection.</p>

      <div class="cov-grid">
        <article class="cov-card">
          <span class="cov-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M12 3v3M12 18v3M3 12h3M18 12h3M5.6 5.6l2.1 2.1M16.3 16.3l2.1 2.1M18.4 5.6l-2.1 2.1M7.7 16.3l-2.1 2.1" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round"></path><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3.2" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"></circle></svg></span>
          <span class="cov-tag">Third-Party Cover</span>
          <h3>Public Liability</h3>
          <p>Public Liability protects against any damage to third parties in and around your property. This policy covers you against bodily or material damage to your guests, your neighbors or any third party for which you are liable — peace of mind against lawsuits when you're responsible for a loss.</p>
          <a href="/public-liability-in-cambodia/" class="link-arrow">Get a Quote <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
        </article>
        <article class="cov-card">
          <span class="cov-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M4 21V9l8-5 8 5v12M9 21v-6h6v6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></span>
          <span class="cov-tag">Condo &bull; House</span>
          <h3>Home Insurance</h3>
          <p>AG Insurance Broker provides exclusive package solutions to cover your condo or your house, including Public Liability, Multi Risks contents protection (including theft), and Home Helper accident cover.</p>
          <a href="#form" class="link-arrow">Get a Quote <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
        </article>
        <article class="cov-card">
          <span class="cov-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M3 17c2 1.4 4.2 1.4 6 0 1.8 1.4 4.2 1.4 6 0 1.8 1.4 4.2 1.4 6 0M5 17V9l4-3h4l4 3v2M9 6v3M15 6v3" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></span>
          <span class="cov-tag">Loss of Income</span>
          <h3>Business Interruption</h3>
          <p>Linked to the Property All Risks policy, Business Interruption Insurance ensures you get compensation when accidental damage to your property puts you at a business loss. If your premises can't operate as usual, the insurer pays compensation for your daily income — or you may choose to limit cover to your daily expenses.</p>
          <a href="#form" class="link-arrow">Get a Quote <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Contact / Quote -->
  <section class="section quote-section" id="form">
    <div class="container quote-grid">
      <div class="quote-copy">
        <p class="eyebrow eyebrow-light">Get a quote</p>
        <h2>Your free property insurance quote within 24 hours</h2>
        <p class="section-lead section-lead-light">Tell us about your property. Compare offers from multiple insurers with clear, professional advice.</p>
        <ul class="check-list check-list-light">
          <li>We compare 15+ insurers to get you the best rate</li>
          <li>Available in French and English</li>
          <li>Officially licensed and registered in Cambodia</li>
          <li>Fully confidential — your request is never spammed</li>
        </ul>
        <div class="quote-cta-row">
          <a href="https://t.me/AGCambodia" class="btn btn-outline-light" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
            <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M21 4 3 11l6 2m12-9-4 16-8-6m0 0 3-2" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg>
            Telegram
          </a>
          <a href="tel:+85523998018" class="btn btn-outline-light">
            <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M6.6 10.8c1.4 2.8 3.8 5.2 6.6 6.6l2.2-2.2c.3-.3.7-.4 1-.2 1.1.4 2.3.6 3.6.6.6 0 1 .4 1 1V20c0 .6-.4 1-1 1C10.9 21 3 13.1 3 3.5c0-.6.4-1 1-1H7.7c.6 0 1 .4 1 1 0 1.3.2 2.5.6 3.6.1.4 0 .8-.2 1L6.6 10.8Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg>
            Call us
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="quote-form-card">
        <p class="quote-form-title">Company &amp; get covered</p>
        <p class="quote-form-sub">Tell us a bit about your property and a broker will call you back within 24 hours.</p>

        <div class="quote-tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="Insurance type">
          <button type="button" class="quote-tab" role="tab" aria-selected="false">Health Insurance</button>
          <button type="button" class="quote-tab" role="tab" aria-selected="false">Vehicle</button>
          <button type="button" class="quote-tab is-active" role="tab" aria-selected="true">Property</button>
          <button type="button" class="quote-tab" role="tab" aria-selected="false">Other</button>
        </div>

        <form id="quote-form" novalidate>
          <div class="form-row">
            <div class="form-field">
              <label for="firstName">First name *</label>
              <input id="firstName" name="firstName" type="text" required autocomplete="given-name" />
            </div>
            <div class="form-field">
              <label for="lastName">Last name *</label>
              <input id="lastName" name="lastName" type="text" required autocomplete="family-name" />
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="form-row">
            <div class="form-field">
              <label for="email">Email *</label>
              <input id="email" name="email" type="email" required autocomplete="email" />
            </div>
            <div class="form-field">
              <label for="phone">Phone / WhatsApp *</label>
              <input id="phone" name="phone" type="tel" required autocomplete="tel" />
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="form-field">
            <label for="message">Message</label>
            <textarea id="message" name="message" rows="4"></textarea>
          </div>
          <button type="submit" class="btn btn-gold btn-block">Request my free quote <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></button>
          <p class="form-note">
            <svg width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><rect x="5" y="11" width="14" height="9" rx="1.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"></rect><path d="M8 11V7a4 4 0 0 1 8 0v4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"></path></svg>
            Your information is 100% confidential
          </p>
          <p class="form-status" id="form-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
        </form>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
